                <head>Extradition treaty between the United States and Uruguay</head>
                <p rendition="#flush"><hi rendition="#italic">Treaty signed at Washington, March 11,
                        1905 Ratification advised</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">with
                    amendments</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">by the Senate March 18, 1905.--Ratified
                        by the President, April 12, 1908 Ratified by Uruguay, May 27, 1908
                        Ratifications exchanged at Montevideo, June 4, 1908 Proclaimed, July 10,
                        1908.</hi></p>

